","source":"Sean 10/15: a passing exchange quote more than this far (probability points) from the median of the books on the same line is flagged outlier and excluded unless 2+ other venues sit within 3 pts of it; one big make order is not a price"},{"name":"exchange_outlier_confirm","value":2,"status":"rule","source":"companion to exchange_outlier_pts: venues within 3 pts needed to keep an outlying exchange quote"},{"name":"disagreement_threshold_ml","value":0.02,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a76 Test B/C (thread definition); revisit after first run"},{"name":"disagreement_threshold_line","value":0.5,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a76 Test B"},{"name":"min_events_game_lines","value":1500,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a76 publication gate"},{"name":"min_prop_rows","value":20000,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a76 publication gate (settled prop rows)"},{"name":"min_pairs_props","value":3000,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a76 Test C publication gate, per venue per sport"},{"name":"min_events_devig_fit","value":2000,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a75; refit at 10,000"},{"name":"weight_cap","value":0.6,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a77"},{"name":"new_venue_days","value":30,"status":"rule","source":"SHARP_TRACKER_BUILD_SPEC_2026-10-14.md \u00a77: venues under 30 days sit at the median weight until 1,500 events"},{"name":"close_window_min","value":20,"status":"rule","source":"Fable 10/14: 'close' = last tick per venue inside this many minutes before first pitch; the 20-minute job cadence means most venues have exactly one tick in the window"},{"name":"horizon_tolerance_min","value":120,"status":"rule","source":"Fable 10/14: the T-24h/6h/1h snapshot is the latest tick at most this old; the game-lines job has b